{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"お米っておいしいよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事に続きまして\n飲食物の話なんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"納豆とかふりかけとか漬け物とか\n食べるラー油とかカリカリじゃことか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイブームは\n海苔の佃煮と多めのわさびを混ぜて\n涙がでそうなギリギリで食べる(・ω・)ｂ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは\nほかほかのご飯に\nなにもかけないで食べるのも\nおいしいと思うんだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも前に\nなんかの番組で\n冷えたご飯がダイエットにいい\nって聞いて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お茶碗の中の\n湯気のでるレベルの\n温かく艶々したごはんを前に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"葛藤だよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ、\n葛藤してる間に\n冷めてくれればいいものを\n優柔不断な中田のはずが\nこういう時にすぐ決まる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(｀▽´)Ψケケケッ\n温かいうちに食べた方が\n絶対おいしいよ！ケケケッ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ε（*´▽｀）☆彡\n炭水化物のかたまりだし\nせめて冷えてからの方がいいよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"￣(=∵=)￣Ψケケケ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああ、\n中田はなんて悪い子。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"野菜ジュースは好き？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n大好き＼^^／\nジュースっぽいのよりは\n甘さ控えめの野菜っぽい方が好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トマト好き？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n大好き！\n野菜大好き！\nやまとまとも好き！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/1610724/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2ndの曲好き？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nいい曲ですよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/1610724/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしててください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたはngng東京個別だね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/1610724/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"券持った？\n納品書持った？\n身分証持った？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、宿題も忘れずにね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/1610724/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子の好きな髪型は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/1610724/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白いごはんのおかずで何が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あした待ってるよー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/30/1610724/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃ、\n今日は早めにおやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}